  "description": "Detective Jayden, who had been conducting a perilous investigation following a tip about a monster on the loose, is suddenly confronted by the vigilante Luke. Although it’s the right thing to do to arrest Luke, a dangerous criminal, in the name of justice, Jayden finds himself increasingly drawn to him as he unabashedly shows his interest from the very beginning....\n\n*“Could that man who was fighting like a monster just a moment ago and this lecherous man really be the same person…?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
